  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EcoVisio - Avfallshantering Moldova 2023-2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EcoVisio - Waste Management CC_Moldova 2023-2026 - Waste Management Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project aims at supporting three Waste Management Regions (5, 8 and 1) in implementing the &#x201c;Solid Waste Management Project&#x201d; in accordance with the National Waste Management Program and Waste Law by developing and implementing Strategic Communication Campaign in Moldova.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att st&#xf6;dja tre avfallshanteringsregioner (5, 8 och 1) i genomf&#xf6;randet av &quot;Projektet f&#xf6;r hantering av fast avfall&quot; i enlighet med det nationella programmet f&#xf6;r avfallshantering och avfallslagstiftningen genom att utveckla och implementera en strategisk kommunikationskampanj i Moldavien.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Objective of the project is to raise the level of awareness and involvement of the key actors in the waste management process for fostering stakeholders engagement and ensuring the successful implementation of the regionalized approach.

The project is drawn up based on the following 4 main objectives:

Objective 1: Mapping the current waste management system based on regional approach and create Strategic Communication Plan;

Objective 2: Fostering the development of expertise and skills in waste prevention and integrated waste management among LPAs and local CSOs;

Objective 3: Developing awareness campaigns aimed at promoting waste reduction and proper waste disposal practices among the general public;

Objective 4: Implementing pilot projects in selected communities that promote the reuse of waste materials and incentivizes residents and businesses to reduce waste generation.</narrative>
  </description>
